#. おい！　苗木！
#. 何やってんだよ、さっさと出口を探せよな！！
msgctxt "0001 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"What're you doing, Makoto!? We gotta hurry up and find\n"
"a way outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Leon"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. 桑田クンと一緒に過ごそうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I hang out with Leon for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ま、まさか、２人きりになった瞬間に、
#. オレの事を殺す気じゃねーだろな…
msgctxt "0005 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Y-You're not trying to get me alone so you can kill\n"
"me, are you...?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事したら、ファンが黙ってねーぞ！
#. オレはアイドル並みの人気者なんだぞ！
msgctxt "0006 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"My fans will all go psycho on you if you do! I'm as\n"
"popular as any international superstar!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、違うならいいけど…
#. むしろ、一緒にいて欲しいけど…
msgctxt "0007 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"But if you're NOT gonna murder me, then let's hang\n"
"out. I don't really wanna be alone, anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンと一緒に過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Leon...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leon and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Leon a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
